# Keeps the build context small and stops the builder stage's `COPY client client` /
# `COPY server server` from ever pulling in a host machine's own node_modules or stale
# dist/ (wrong platform-native binaries, or masking a real build failure with leftovers).
**/node_modules
**/dist
server/.pgdata
server/.pgdata-test
server/.pgdata-scale
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.claude

backups
docs
client/e2e/.auth
client/test-results
client/playwright-report

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
